This fork adds, relative to upstream:

- the GGsel Seller API V1 adapter;
- `SellerHub` — one normalized `HubEvent` stream across several accounts, with
  a per-session `platform`/`session_id`;
- durable listener state through `StateStore` / `SQLiteStateStore`;
- the `Capability` matrix describing what each platform supports;
- proxy support for FunPay, Playerok and GGsel;
- `AIOSELLERS_MEDIA_ROOTS`, which confines the local filesystem paths that media
  uploads are allowed to read.

